# Same Supabase project as the mobile apps. ANON key only — the console runs
# every query as the signed-in staff member under RLS, so a bug here cannot
# read more than that person's roles allow.
#
# The service-role key must NEVER appear in this file or in this app.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
